# Removing Files
>This challenge will create a delete_me file in your home directory! Delete it, then run /challenge/check, which will make sure you've deleted it and then give you the flag!

## Solve:
- Removed using 'rm' command.
```
bash
hacker@commands~removing-files:~$ ls
c  delete_me
hacker@commands~removing-files:~$ rm delete_me
hacker@commands~removing-files:~$ ls
c
hacker@commands~removing-files:~$ /challenge/check
Excellent removal. Here is your reward:
pwn.college{w9K8jC1vXKGekD6BVWRdFyGnVWk.QX2kDM1wiM4ETOwIzW}
```
## Flag
```
put{w9K8jC1vXKGekD6BVWRdFyGnVWk.QX2kDM1wiM4ETOwIzW}
